                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Wild, irrational, undisciplined, orgiastic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b796e05d-9cae-4e04-a484-46fdfbce1a63",
                                                "sense_id": "b2ccad8c-606b-36b8-af18-346e92565234",
                                                "text": "He said he loved making movies like Luca Guadagnino’s “A Bigger Splash,” in which his charismatic, obstreperous character, Harry Hawkes, a music producer described by the Italian director as “a pagan fawn,” does a Dionysian dance to the Rolling Stones song “Emotional Rescue.”"
